      "intro": "Read the email. Tap Listen to hear it in French. Then answer the 5 questions in English. Tap Show the answer to check.",
      "text": "Le soir, je regarde la télé. J'adore Le Bigdil (c'est un jeu télévisé) et Sous le soleil (c'est une série). J'aime la lecture aussi. Je préfère les livres de Harry Potter et les magazines de musique pop. Le week-end dernier, j'ai mangé avec ma famille et après, j'ai regardé un film sur Netflix.",
      "signed": "Marine",
      "correction_note": "Corrected spelling. The booklet says 'j'ai mange' and 'en Netflix'. The correct French is 'j'ai mangé' and 'sur Netflix'.",
      "source": "booklet",
      "questions": [
        { "q": "What sort of programme is 'Sous le soleil'?", "a": "A series (une série).", "source": "booklet" },
        { "q": "What is the French name of the game show Marine likes?", "a": "Le Bigdil.", "source": "booklet" },
        { "q": "Name two things she likes reading.", "a": "Harry Potter books and pop music magazines.", "source": "booklet" },
        { "q": "Last weekend, who did she eat with?", "a": "Her family.", "source": "booklet" },
        { "q": "What did she do afterwards?", "a": "She watched a film on Netflix.", "source": "booklet" }
      ]
    },
